  "solutions": [
    {
      "id": "sol.amc-10a-2012-p2.live",
      "kind": "proof-sketch",
      "text": "Note that the one of the sides remains the same as the original square.\n\nThis means that one dimension is \\(8.\\) The other dimension is the original side cut in half, which is \\(4.\\)\n\nThus, E is the correct answer.",
